minic: Mini-C educational compiler

Usage:
  minic --help
  minic --tokens <file>
  minic --ast <file>
  minic --resolve <file>
  minic --check <file>
  minic --bytecode <file>
  minic --bytecode-opt <file>
  minic --run <file>
  minic --run-vm <file>
  minic --run-vm-opt <file>

Print token types, source text, and line:column positions.
Use --ast to print the syntax tree.
Use --resolve to print scopes, symbols, and name bindings.
Use --check to analyze Mini-C types.
Use --bytecode to print Mini-C instructions.
Use --bytecode-opt to print optimized Mini-C instructions.
Use --run to execute Mini-C programs.
Use --run-vm to compile and execute Mini-C on the VM.
Use --run-vm-opt to optimize and execute Mini-C on the VM.
